Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Map: read the U.S. state from the saved location text, place known cities from a bundled
  table (no geocoding service), otherwise at the state centre (marked approximate).
  Fixes 'Durham, NH' / 'Charlotte, MI' being pinned in North Carolina.
- New 'map area' filter; Market filter, bulk 'Set market', dashboard and pipeline market lists
  now come from the data instead of a fixed NC list; record editor Market is free text.
- HR person listed: unknown stays 'Unknown' (never an assumed 'No') at every layer — EMPTY_P,
  database read fallback, search-source mappers; stricter HR-title check (no 'Three', 'Chris').
  Fit score treats Unknown as neutral and a recorded 'No' as 'confirm'. Editor and filter gain 'Unknown'.
- Migration 20261023: new rows default hr_person_listed to 'Unknown' (existing rows untouched).
- docs/ACCEPTANCE_CHECKLIST.md (live-site checks) and docs/verify_migrations.sql (which migrations are applied).
- Remove stray prospects-upgrade.patch.
